{"id":"n66770-1-5","stage":5,"title":"알몸 · 裸体","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n66770-1-5-1","ko":"사람들이 전부 벗고 있는 목욕탕인데 뭘 수건으로 가리니?","zh":"这里可是大家都光着身子泡澡的浴场，用毛巾遮什么啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"사람들이","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"전부","meaning":"全部","explanation":"전부：全部","readings":[{"term":"전부","audio":"/audio/47f5c6ba3e704438d2c3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25302","senseId":"1","lemma":"전부","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"벗고","meaning":"脱下，摘下","explanation":"벗다：脱下，摘下；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"벗다","audio":"/audio/5e0de3d2fcfbee1a21e3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58494","senseId":"1","lemma":"벗다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있는","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"목욕탕인데","meaning":"公共浴室，澡堂","explanation":"목욕탕：公共浴室，澡堂；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"목욕탕","audio":"/audio/223fa6fe717158f9de26.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55877","senseId":"1","lemma":"목욕탕","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뭘","meaning":"没什么，哪里","explanation":"뭘：没什么，哪里","readings":[{"term":"뭘","audio":"/audio/441ab920d2baa0d1bea5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67413","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"수건으로","meaning":"毛巾","explanation":"수건：毛巾；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"수건","audio":"/audio/66661500c7bf41ffb4cc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26856","senseId":"1","lemma":"수건","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가리니?","meaning":"遮挡，遮盖","explanation":"가리다：遮挡，遮盖；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"가리다","audio":"/audio/2015aa077867f9c06e04.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15216","senseId":"1","lemma":"가리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人们，大家","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"对没有特别指定的，自己以外的人的称呼。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"47f5c6ba3e704438","term":"전부","zh":"全部","audio":"/audio/47f5c6ba3e704438d2c3.mp3","entryId":"25302","definition":"一个不漏全都。","pronunciation":["전부"]},{"id":"5e0de3d2fcfbee1a","term":"벗다","zh":"脱下，摘下","audio":"/audio/5e0de3d2fcfbee1a21e3.mp3","entryId":"58494","definition":"人从身上取下所持的东西或衣服等。","pronunciation":["벋따"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"223fa6fe717158f9","term":"목욕탕","zh":"公共浴室，澡堂","audio":"/audio/223fa6fe717158f9de26.mp3","entryId":"55877","definition":"供人洗澡用的设施或房间。","pronunciation":["모굑탕"]},{"id":"441ab920d2baa0d1","term":"뭘","zh":"没什么，哪里","audio":"/audio/441ab920d2baa0d1bea5.mp3","entryId":"67413","definition":"对对方的称赞或感谢表示谦让。","pronunciation":["뭘"]},{"id":"66661500c7bf41ff","term":"수건","zh":"毛巾","audio":"/audio/66661500c7bf41ffb4cc.mp3","entryId":"26856","definition":"用来擦去身体、脸、手上水分的织物。","pronunciation":["수ː건"]},{"id":"2015aa077867f9c0","term":"가리다","zh":"遮挡，遮盖","audio":"/audio/2015aa077867f9c06e04.mp3","entryId":"15216","definition":"挡住、隐藏或使不通。","pronunciation":["가리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/02a8665aeb318786daa7.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n66770-1-5-2","ko":"난 알몸으로 있는 게 부끄러워.","zh":"我光着身子会觉得很尴尬。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"난","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"알몸으로","meaning":"裸体，赤身","explanation":"알몸：裸体，赤身；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"알몸","audio":"/audio/4ab7211c0f706ce04756.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66770","senseId":"1","lemma":"알몸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있는","meaning":"处于，处在","explanation":"있다：处于，处在；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68796","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"게","meaning":"东西，事，的","explanation":"것：东西，事，的；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"1","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"부끄러워.","meaning":"害羞，羞涩，腼腆","explanation":"부끄럽다：害羞，羞涩，腼腆；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"부끄럽다","audio":"/audio/3109572de7c050e1c422.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60125","senseId":"1","lemma":"부끄럽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"4ab7211c0f706ce0","term":"알몸","zh":"裸体，赤身","audio":"/audio/4ab7211c0f706ce04756.mp3","entryId":"66770","definition":"没有穿任何东西的身体。","pronunciation":["알몸"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"处于，处在","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68796","definition":"人或动物继续保持某种状态。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"东西，事，的","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"泛指各种事物或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"3109572de7c050e1","term":"부끄럽다","zh":"害羞，羞涩，腼腆","audio":"/audio/3109572de7c050e1c422.mp3","entryId":"60125","definition":"感到不好意思或难为情。","pronunciation":["부끄럽따"]}],"audio":"/audio/b9410ee791e7443aa9d5.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.373,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWo